// The youth club (world/gen/maps/youthClub.ts): Siv who runs it, and two regulars.
// One line each, no questions.

=== youthWorker ===
{~Welcome to the club! Arcade's free, pool's free, the sofa is first come first served.|The falling blocks machine keeps a high score. Thomas's is on there. Near the bottom.|Those cabinets used to be on Thomas's old website, would you believe it. Now they live here.|Shoes off on the rug, please. It was a donation.}
-> END

=== clubGamer ===
{~Don't talk to me, I'm on level seven.|Press up to turn the piece. Nobody told me that for a week.|The dungeon one plays itself if you let it. I let it.}
-> END

=== clubLounger ===
{~This bean bag has seen things.|Siv says we can have a console tournament if we tidy up. We will not tidy up.|The Life machine never ends. I've been watching it since lunch.}
-> END
